# A draft: words left in the field, the chat left and opened again: they are back.
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
wait 1000
tap 发消息
type 还没发出去的草稿 {T}
wait 1200
shot 1-typed
tap icon:chevron-left
wait 1000
until 端到端测试
shot 2-home
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
wait 1000
field 还没发出去的草稿 {T}
shot 3-back-again
